  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ECSOs joint Action for the Promotion of Nature 2000 Network in Albania - APN2000</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;The action&#xBF;s Overall Objective is the &#xBF;strengthening the role and capacity of civil society in contributing to the implementation, identification and approval of environmental conservation policies, measures and laws in Albania that are effective, efficient and in line with the EU&#xBF;s Natura 2000 Network&#xBF;. The Specific Objective is &#xBF;Increase the capacities of local ECSOs and LAGs in improving environmental protection and biodiversity conservation actions in Vlora Bay from Vjosa-Narta Protected Landscape to Karaburun-Sazan National Marine Park&#xBF;. The project is implemented by Centro Laici Italiani per le Missioni - CELIM&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
